# Coding Standards
Follow clean code principles. Keep functions small and single-purpose.
Use meaningful variable names. Avoid magic numbers.

# Architecture
Prefer dependency injection. Use SOLID principles.
Separate concerns: presentation, business logic, data access.

# Documentation
Add comments for complex logic. Document public APIs.
Keep README updated with setup instructions.

# Git Guidelines
Write atomic commits. Use conventional commit messages.
Never commit secrets or credentials.
